@startuml
actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Nexo" as System
Admin -> System: Register a member's email to the organization (email)
System -> System: Validate email, check authorization, plan limit, and uniqueness
alt Valid, authorized, under limit, and email available
    System --> Admin: Email added to the organization's eligible list
else Invalid, unauthorized, limit reached, or email already registered
    System --> Admin: Registration rejected (validation, authorization, limit, or conflict error)
end
@enduml
